March: 8 steps (eighth notes), bass pattern [E2, E2, D2, D2, C2, C2, B1, B1] = [82.41, 82.41, 73.42, 73.42, 65.41, 65.41, 61.74, 61.74]. Each step: square osc at freq, gain 0.5, decay 0.18; sub sine at freq/2, gain 0.4, decay 0.22. Hat: noise 0.03s, highpass 6000, gain 0.15, on every step (or off-beat). Scheduler: setInterval 25ms, while (nextTime < now + 0.12) { scheduleStep(step, nextTime); nextTime += 60/bpm/2; step = (step+1)%8 }.

Siren: osc sine 440, gain 0.12, LFO osc 6Hz → lfoGain 120 → osc.frequency. Save the nodes; stop on kill.

All sfx go through this._ensure() — if ctx is null (no gesture yet), silently skip.

